SUMMARY:Meridian Arts Centre:  Canadian Golha Orchestra and Sepideh Raissa
 dat
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nIn this unforgettable concert\, **the 
 Canadian Golha Orchestra joins forces with acclaimed Persian music vocalis
 t Sepideh Raissadat** to present rarely performed masterpieces of Iranian 
 orchestral music. Timeless works by Rouhollah Khaleghi\, Ali-Naqi Vaziri\,
  Ali Tajvidi\, and other pioneering composers will be brought to life thro
 ugh Raissadat’s velvety voice and the 40-piece orchestra’s expressive 
 interpretation of these intricate and captivating melodies.\n\n***INFO Lin
 k here--***\n\nhttps://tolive.com/Event-Details-Page/reference/Canadian-Go
 lha-Orchestra-2026?utm_medium=crosspromo&utm_source=partner&utm_campaign=c
 anadiangolhaorchestra2026&utm_content=torontoisculture\n\nTicket link is b
 elow.\n\nInspired by the legacy of the *historic Golha radio orchestra*\, 
 the Canadian Golha Orchestra offers a refined interpretation of beloved re
 pertoire by past masters\, rooted in the Dastgāh tradition\, alongside wo
 rks by contemporary composers. Together\, **the 40-piece orchestra** and R
 aissadat’s heartfelt artistry promise to immerse audiences in the profou
 nd beauty and emotional depth of Persian music.\n\n**More info here:**\n\n
 https://tolive.com/Event-Details-Page/reference/Canadian-Golha-Orchestra-2
 026\n\n**Ticket link here: ($45-$100)**\n\nhttps://am.ticketmaster.com/tol
 ive/canadiangolhaorchestra-2026\n\n(Play around with the seating map (+) -
 -ensuring you sit where you want!)
