SUMMARY:The Theatre Centre:  VERSUS (Comedy/Promo Price!)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n##### A World Premiere \\| Co\\-Produc
 ed by Quiptake Theatre\\\, The Theatre Centre\\\, and the National Arts Ce
 ntre’s National Creation Fund\n\nIt’s Gerald Bloom’s birthday and he
  doesn’t want to go to his party — Everything feels like a fight. Join
  Gerald on a wild ride through the horror\, comedy\, delusion\, grief\, an
 d joy of being human. **Feel Alive Again.**\n\nTickets are $35 (using our 
 promo code) Details below. A very FUN afternoon!!!\n\nCreated by award-win
 ning Canadian collaborators **Adam Lazarus**\, **Guillermo Verdecchia**\, 
 and **Ann-Marie Kerr** comes a laugh-out-loud experience that can only hap
 pen in the theatre. Cake included.\n\nhttps://theatrecentre.org/event/vers
 us/\n\n**Ticket link here--(you are purchasing for Sunday 15th 2pm)**\n\nU
 se the PROMO/coupon code for $10 off: CRISISISART\n\nhttps://theatrecentre
 .org/tickets/?eid=202982\n\nIf needed\, you can also call the Box Office\n
 \n416-538-0988\n\nboxoffice@theatrecentre.org
