SUMMARY:November ART Crawl (#2): Tour 3 top private galleries/spaces ($10 
 per person)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe will continue with our monthly **Ar
 t Crawls**!\n\n***Please read everything over first.***\n\n\\*\\*\\*Novemb
 er Art Crawl #2 = Saturday November 21rst (1:30pm-3:30pm)\n\n18 people/mem
 bers this time.\n\nSTARTING in the Yonge/Dundas area.\n\n**$10 per person.
 **\n\n**\\*\\*\\*Sent via e-transfer when you signup/rsvp.**\n\n**I'm not 
 able to HOLD space for you.**\n\n***--We will visit 3 different*** (downto
 wn/west end/east end) galleries each month **(with short walks between eac
 h one)**\n\nEach month will be different galleries and/or artist-run centr
 es.\n\n\\*\\*We'll meet the Gallery owners/artists/directors--\nwho will l
 ead us in tours and conversation at each stop.\n\nNO weather cancellations
 ---**we will carry on!**\n\nNO cancellations/no refunds or any re-scheduli
 ng if you cannot make it.\n\n\\-\\-\\-Check your calendars and PLAN ahead 
 if you can join us\\-\\-and please be on time\\. We're not able to wait fo
 r you\\. Sorry\n\nAre you interested in ART/artists--**and learning/visiti
 ng**\n**the exceptional local commercial galleries we have in Toronto? Wit
 h other MEETUP members.**\n\nSaturday November 21 ***(1pm-3pm)***\n\nOnce 
 I have 18 **confirmations** from Meetup members (you)--I will email you th
 e start location of our November #2 ART Crawl!!\n\n**Our first stop**. Yon
 ge/Dundas area (we then head EAST)\n\nIf interested\, please email me $10.
 \n\nInclude your first name only\, and email address for a reply.\n\n**I w
 ill then confirm you.**\n\nAnd will firm up our itinerary with you next we
 ek.\n\nSee you on Saturday November 21rst--if you're confirmed--watch for 
 an email directly from me!!\n\n***We are doing this again in November--as 
 many exceptional current exhibitions. And*** ongoing all Winter---as we fi
 nd some interesting spaces and exhibitions.\n\nEach month will be posted s
 eparately.\n\nYou can email me directly here:\n\ntorontoisculture@gmail.co
 m\n\nGreg\n\nThank you.
