SUMMARY:Terminal Theatre/Harbourfront:  Canadian Contemporay Dance  
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n*Please join us for another afternoon 
 of Contemporary Dance!*\n\nEvery December we attend **WINTERSONG**--annual
  performance by Canadian Contemporary Dance Theatre (CCDT)\n\nhttps://www.
 ccdt.org/wintersong2026 (all the details)\n\nTicket link is below. $35-$55
 \n\nA longstanding seasonal tradition celebrating the solstice\, WINTERSON
 G has warmed the hearts of family audiences for almost four decades. This 
 year we are delighted to feature two World Premieres by Madeleine Salhany 
 (Ballet Jazz Montréal) and Toronto’s street dance maestro\, Raoul Pilla
 y + works by Elon Höglund\, Carol Anderson and Colin Connor.\n\\*\\*A tho
 roughly refreshing take on the season - Michael Crabb\, Toronto Star​\n
 ​\n\n**Ticket link here:** (you are purchasing for Sunday Dec 13th 2pm s
 how)\n\nhttps://ci.ovationtix.com/terminaltheatre/production/1280669?perfo
 rmanceId=11829706
